"'''Ridin'''{{-"}} is a song by American rapper [[Chamillionaire]] featuring fellow American rapper [[Krayzie Bone]] of [[Bone Thugs-n-Harmony]], released on November 12, 2005, as the second single from his debut studio album ''[[The Sound of Revenge]]'' (2005).<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.allmusic.com/album/the-sound-of-revenge-mw0000170804 |title=The Sound of Revenge – Chamillionaire {{!}} Songs, Reviews, Credits |publisher=[[AllMusic]] |date=November 22, 2005 |access-date=March 21, 2022}}</ref> Produced by [[Hip-hop production|hip hop producers]] [[Play-N-Skillz]], the song's lyrics discuss [[racial profiling]] and [[police brutality]], in addition to the [[Stereotypes of African Americans|stereotyping of African Americans]] driving a vehicle with [[Narcotic|drugs]] and other [[contraband]] on the inside (riding dirty).

